/-! # Conv IBP scorecard, image chunk A — test images #0, #1, #2, #3

Per-image propagated boxes for the conv net of `IbpConvScorecardNet.lean`:
the layer-1 box via the uniform collapse, its ReLU/max-pool image, and the
`CertifiedAtLinf3` theorem at each certifying radius. Split off so that no
single module carries every image — peak elaboration tracks the images in
the module, not the corpus (see the generator). The aggregate lives in
`IbpConvScorecard.lean`. Generated by `scripts/ibp_conv_scorecard.py`. -/

